:name: Motion platform controller, live
:description: motion.resc plus a bridge from the emulated CAN bus to the host's SocketCAN vcan0, and the UART log in a file, for the host tools.

# Required: $elf. Host prerequisite (Linux/WSL): modprobe vcan; ip link add dev vcan0 type vcan; ip link set up vcan0

include $ORIGIN/motion.resc

machine CreateSocketCANBridge "socketcan" "vcan0"
connector Connect socketcan canHub

sysbus.usart2 CreateFileBackend @/tmp/motion_uart.log true
